---
import { data, url, hasAsset } from '../lib/site';
const s = data.stats;
const batchShot = hasAsset('screenshots/batch-queue.webp') ? 'screenshots/batch-queue.webp' : null;
const cutoutShot = hasAsset('screenshots/image-cutout.webp') ? 'screenshots/image-cutout.webp' : null;
const docShot = ['screenshots/doc-extract.webp', 'screenshots/doc-extract-images.webp'].find(hasAsset) || null;
---

<section class="section" id="features">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div class="eyebrow">为什么选它</div>
      <h2 class="h2">琐碎的素材活儿，<span class="grad-text">一个工具全包</span></h2>
      <p class="lead">做表情包、给公众号压 GIF、把几百 MB 的 PPT 瘦身、批量换图片格式……不用再在十几个网站和软件之间来回切换，也不用把文件传给任何人。</p>
    </div>

    <div class="bento">
      <!-- 隐私 -->
      <article class="card tile t-privacy reveal">
        <div class="tile-icon">🔒</div>
        <h3>文件永远不离开你的电脑</h3>
        <p>所有处理都由本机 FFmpeg、Resvg、SVGO 完成，没有服务器，没有账号，断网也能用。合同截图、内部 PPT、私人视频都可以放心处理。</p>
        <div class="privacy-flow" aria-hidden="true">
          <span class="pf-node">📁 你的文件</span>
          <span class="pf-line"><i></i></span>
          <span class="pf-node pf-core">💻 本机处理</span>
          <span class="pf-line"><i></i></span>
          <span class="pf-node">✅ 成品</span>
          <span class="pf-cloud">☁️ <s>上传</s></span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 批量 -->
      <article class="card tile t-batch reveal">
        <div class="tile-icon">📦</div>
        <h3>拖进一堆文件，批量处理</h3>
        <p>{s.batchFeatures} 个功能支持多文件队列：可以随时添加、移除、中途取消，单个文件失败不会影响其他文件。</p>
        {batchShot && (
          <div class="shot-frame">
            <img
              class="tile-shot"
              src={url(batchShot)}
              alt="批量队列处理完成后的界面截图"
              data-caption="批量队列处理：一次拖入多个文件顺序处理，实时显示各自压缩率"
              data-zoomable
              loading="lazy"
              width="1440"
              height="900"
            />
            <span class="shot-zoom-badge" aria-hidden="true">🔍 放大</span>
          </div>
        )}
      </article>

      <!-- 目标大小 -->
      <article class="card tile t-target reveal">
        <div class="tile-icon">🎯</div>
        <h3>压到指定大小，一次到位</h3>
        <p>视频按码率反推，GIF 最多迭代 7 轮，图片用二分搜索画质，直接满足平台上传限制。</p>
        <div class="size-chips" aria-label="常用目标大小预设">
          <span>200 KB</span><span>1 MB</span><span>5 MB</span><span>10 MB · Discord</span><span>25 MB · 微信</span><span>50 MB</span>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- 文档 -->
      <article class="card tile t-doc reveal">
        <div class="tile-icon">📑</div>
        <h3>Word / PPT 图片：提取、压缩、放回原位</h3>
        <p>自动识别 .docx / .pptx 里的所有图片，可以只处理指定章节或页面，原位压缩、打码、美化后再写回文档，文字和排版完全不变。</p>
        {docShot ? (
          <div class="shot-frame">
            <img
              class="tile-shot"
              src={url(docShot)}
              alt="Word / PPT 提取图片界面截图"
              data-caption="文档图片提取与原位回填：支持按章节筛选、贴剪贴板替换并一键写回原 Word/PPT"
              data-zoomable
              loading="lazy"
              width="1440"
              height="900"
            />
            <span class="shot-zoom-badge" aria-hidden="true">🔍 放大</span>
          </div>
        ) : (
          <div class="doc-flow" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="df-file">📄 方案.pptx<em>含大量原图</em></span>
            <span class="df-arrow">→</span>
            <span class="df-imgs"><i></i><i></i><i></i><i></i></span>
            <span class="df-arrow">→</span>
            <span class="df-file ok">📄 方案_已压缩.pptx<em>排版不变 · 体积更小</em></span>
          </div>
        )}
      </article>

      <!-- 抠图 -->
      <article class="card tile t-cutout reveal">
        <div class="tile-icon">🪄</div>
        <h3>抠图、换背景、转矢量</h3>
        <p>纯色或绿幕一键抠成透明底，换纯色、渐变或图片背景；还能把 Logo 描摹成可以无限放大的 SVG。</p>
        {cutoutShot && (
          <div class="shot-frame cutout-crop">
            <img
              class="tile-shot"
              src={url(cutoutShot)}
              alt="抠图 / 更换背景功能截图"
              data-caption="纯色/绿幕抠图透明 PNG：实时容差与边缘羽化调节，一键导出透明底"
              data-zoomable
              loading="lazy"
              width="1440"
              height="900"
            />
            <span class="shot-zoom-badge" aria-hidden="true">🔍 放大</span>
          </div>
        )}
      </article>

      <!-- 小卡片 -->
      <article class="card tile mini reveal">
        <div class="tile-icon">⚡</div>
        <h3>GPU 硬件加速</h3>
        <p>自动检测 NVIDIA NVENC、Intel QSV、AMD AMF，视频编码提速数倍。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card tile mini reveal">
        <div class="tile-icon">🔍</div>
        <h3>放大对比</h3>
        <p>并排同步缩放平移，或者拖动卷帘对比。视频、GIF、位图和 SVG 都支持。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card tile mini reveal">
        <div class="tile-icon">🧠</div>
        <h3>增量智能缓存</h3>
        <p>只改了下游参数？上游已经算过的节点直接命中缓存，秒出结果。</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card tile mini reveal">
        <div class="tile-icon">🛡️</div>
        <h3>防覆盖与隐私清理</h3>
        <p>输出自动编号不覆盖原文件；一键去掉照片和视频里的 GPS、设备型号等元数据。</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .bento {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(6, 1fr);
    gap: 18px;
  }
  .tile { padding: 28px; position: relative; overflow: hidden; display: flex; flex-direction: column; }
  .tile:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); border-color: var(--border-3); }
  .tile h3 { font-size: 19px; line-height: 1.4; margin: 14px 0 8px; font-weight: 650; }
  .tile p { color: var(--text-2); font-size: 15px; }
  .tile-icon {
    width: 42px; height: 42px; border-radius: 12px;
    display: grid; place-items: center; font-size: 20px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .055);
    border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
  }

  .shot-frame {
    position: relative;
    margin-top: 22px;
    border-radius: 11px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
    overflow: hidden;
    background: #0d0e13;
    box-shadow: 0 22px 44px -22px rgba(0, 0, 0, .75);
  }
  .tile-shot {
    width: 100%; height: auto; display: block;
    transition: transform .35s var(--ease);
  }
  .shot-frame:hover .tile-shot { transform: scale(1.015); }
  .t-doc .shot-frame, .t-cutout .shot-frame { margin-top: auto; }
  .t-doc p, .t-cutout p { margin-bottom: 22px; }
  /* 裁去 image-cutout.webp 顶部滚动残影，保留完整参数面板与前后透明抠图对比 */
  .cutout-crop { aspect-ratio: 16 / 9.4; }
  .cutout-crop .tile-shot {
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    object-position: center bottom;
  }
  .shot-zoom-badge {
    position: absolute;
    right: 10px;
    bottom: 10px;
    padding: 3px 9px;
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-size: 11.5px;
    color: #fff;
    background: rgba(11, 12, 16, .76);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, .16);
    backdrop-filter: blur(8px);
    opacity: 0;
    transform: translateY(4px);
    transition: opacity .2s, transform .2s;
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  .shot-frame:hover .shot-zoom-badge { opacity: 1; transform: none; }

  .t-privacy { grid-column: span 3; }
  .t-batch { grid-column: span 3; grid-row: span 2; }
  .t-target { grid-column: span 3; }
  .t-doc { grid-column: span 3; }
  .t-cutout { grid-column: span 3; }
  .mini { grid-column: span 3; }
  @media (min-width: 1100px) {
    .bento { grid-template-columns: repeat(12, 1fr); }
    .t-privacy { grid-column: span 5; }
    .t-batch { grid-column: span 7; grid-row: span 2; }
    .t-target { grid-column: span 5; }
    .t-doc { grid-column: span 6; }
    .t-cutout { grid-column: span 6; }
    .mini { grid-column: span 3; }
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .bento { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
    .bento > * { grid-column: auto !important; grid-row: auto !important; }
  }

  .t-privacy { background: radial-gradient(120% 90% at 0% 0%, rgba(61, 214, 140, .10), transparent 60%), linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, .035), rgba(255, 255, 255, .015)); }
  .t-batch { background: radial-gradient(100% 70% at 100% 0%, rgba(124, 116, 255, .16), transparent 60%), linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(255, 255, 255, .035), rgba(255, 255, 255, .015)); }
  .t-batch .shot-frame { margin-top: auto; }
  .t-batch p { margin-bottom: 22px; }

  /* 隐私流程示意 */
  .privacy-flow {
    margin-top: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px;
    position: relative; padding-top: 26px;
  }
  .pf-node {
    font-size: 13px; padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 9px;
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .05); border: 1px solid var(--border-2);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }
  .pf-core { border-color: rgba(61, 214, 140, .45); background: rgba(61, 214, 140, .08); color: #b9f5d6; }
  .pf-line { flex: 1; min-width: 24px; height: 2px; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, .08); position: relative; overflow: hidden; border-radius: 2px; }
  .pf-line i { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 40%; background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--success), transparent); animation: flow 2.2s linear infinite; }
  .pf-cloud { position: absolute; top: 0; right: 0; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-3); }
  .pf-cloud s { text-decoration-color: #f47067; text-decoration-thickness: 2px; }
  @keyframes flow { from { transform: translateX(-100%); } to { transform: translateX(260%); } }

  .size-chips { margin-top: 20px; display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
  .size-chips span {
    font-size: 13px; padding: 5px 11px; border-radius: 999px;
    background: var(--accent-soft); color: #d6d3ff; border: 1px solid rgba(124, 116, 255, .3);
    font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums;
  }

  .doc-flow { margin-top: 24px; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
  .df-file {
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; font-size: 13px; padding: 10px 14px; border-radius: 10px;
    background: rgba(96, 165, 250, .08); border: 1px solid rgba(96, 165, 250, .3);
  }
  .df-file em { font-style: normal; font-size: 12px; color: var(--text-3); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .df-file.ok { background: rgba(61, 214, 140, .08); border-color: rgba(61, 214, 140, .35); }
  .df-file.ok em { color: var(--success); }
  .df-arrow { color: var(--text-3); }
  .df-imgs { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 18px); gap: 4px; }
  .df-imgs i { width: 18px; height: 14px; border-radius: 3px; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #818cf8, #34d399); opacity: .8; }

  .mini h3 { font-size: 16.5px; }
  .mini p { font-size: 14px; }
</style>
